<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Match says 1996 profit flat.</title>
<headline>Swedish Match says 1996 profit flat.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish tobacco company Swedish Match presented these earnings for 1996 on Monday.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit				 1,109  vs  1,097</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (crowns)	    1.10  vs    n/a</p>
<p> Sales					7,416  vs  7,435</p>
<p> Earnings per share (crowns)	   2.39  vs   2.37</p>
<p> Operating costs			  5,439  vs  5,668</p>
<p> Depreciation				 270  vs    294</p>
<p> Interests in associates		   16  vs     21</p>
<p> Nonrecurring items		CHARGE 123  vs    189 CREDIT</p>
<p> Operating profit			 1,600  vs  1,683</p>
<p> Net financial items		CHARGE 70  vs    107 CHARGE</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			   1,530  vs  1,576</p>
<p> Tax					    439  vs    473</p>
<p> Minorities			   CREDIT 18  vs	6 CHARGE</p>
<p>NOTE -- A Reuter poll of eight analysts showed expectations of 1.53 billion crowns for the company's 1996 pre-tax profit.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
